WEBVTT

00:00:09.473 --> 00:00:10.474
[YELLS]

00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:12.084
Ow!

00:00:14.435 --> 00:00:15.436
[GRUNTING]

00:00:16.437 --> 00:00:17.742
[BOTH CHITTERING]

00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:21.920
[YELLS]

00:00:23.835 --> 00:00:25.271
Get them, Mom!

00:00:31.582 --> 00:00:32.583
[CHUCKLES]

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:40.504
[GRUNTS]

00:00:45.596 --> 00:00:46.771
[SCREAMS]

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:51.733
[SNIGGERS]

00:00:51.776 --> 00:00:56.607
Old lady down!
Eep, avenge me!

00:00:58.087 --> 00:00:59.436
[PANTING]

00:01:04.049 --> 00:01:05.094
[YELPS]

00:01:05.137 --> 00:01:06.400
Thanks.

00:01:06.878 --> 00:01:07.923
[GROANS]

00:01:07.966 --> 00:01:08.967
[CHUCKLES]

00:01:09.577 --> 00:01:10.665
[GRUNTS]

00:01:15.626 --> 00:01:17.019
GRUG: Eep!

00:01:17.062 --> 00:01:18.760
Heads up!

00:01:19.456 --> 00:01:20.457
[GRUNTS]

00:01:20.501 --> 00:01:21.502
[PANTING]

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.331
[BOTH GRUNTING]

00:01:29.335 --> 00:01:30.336
[CHUCKLES]

00:01:33.339 --> 00:01:34.384
[ROARS]

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:35.429
[GASPS]

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:39.781
[GASPS]

00:01:44.699 --> 00:01:45.874
[GRUNTS]

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:50.835
[GRUNTS]

00:01:56.667 --> 00:01:58.582
Oh, hey Dad,
can we eat now?

00:01:58.626 --> 00:02:00.758
Just wait
till we get home.

00:02:00.802 --> 00:02:03.195
Eep, put on the brakes.

00:02:03.239 --> 00:02:04.370
[BOTH GRUNT]

00:02:12.553 --> 00:02:13.510
[YELPS]

00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:25.522
Eep!

00:02:25.566 --> 00:02:26.741
ALL: Whoa!

00:02:32.921 --> 00:02:34.096
[ALL SCREAMING]

00:02:38.056 --> 00:02:39.057
[GRUNTING]

00:02:43.932 --> 00:02:45.194
[GROANS]

00:02:46.238 --> 00:02:47.675
Who is hungry?
ALL: Yay!

00:02:47.718 --> 00:02:49.198
All right!
Good one, Dad.

00:02:49.241 --> 00:02:51.592
Here you go,
Thunk. Drink up.
Oh!

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:55.465
Sorry, Dad.

00:02:55.509 --> 00:02:56.814
Looks like
fast food tonight.

00:02:58.381 --> 00:02:59.382
[SQUEALS]

00:03:01.645 --> 00:03:02.646
EEP: Mmm!

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.128
Mmm!

00:03:06.171 --> 00:03:07.303
[EXHALES]

00:03:10.393 --> 00:03:12.134
[GRUG SWALLOWS]

00:03:12.177 --> 00:03:15.354
That's all right.
I ate last week.

00:03:18.575 --> 00:03:20.664
Two knuckle warning!

00:03:20.708 --> 00:03:23.232
Come on, Croods.
Go, go.

00:03:24.102 --> 00:03:26.452
[DISTANT ANIMAL CALLS]

00:03:26.496 --> 00:03:29.455
Come on, come on.
Darkness brings death.
We know this.

00:03:30.413 --> 00:03:32.937
The moon is full.
Bath night.

00:03:32.981 --> 00:03:34.112
Run for your life!

00:03:34.156 --> 00:03:35.549
You too, Mom.
[GRUNTS]

00:03:35.592 --> 00:03:37.899
I don't want to lose
my protective layer.

00:03:37.942 --> 00:03:39.596
Mom, you've got ants.

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:41.293
[BABBLING]

00:03:41.337 --> 00:03:43.426
See?
Sandy doesn't fuss.

00:03:44.296 --> 00:03:45.471
[GRUMBLING]

00:03:46.951 --> 00:03:48.518
[GRUNTING]

00:03:48.562 --> 00:03:49.867
Is she still out there?

00:03:49.911 --> 00:03:52.043
You know she hates
the cave, Grug.

00:03:54.698 --> 00:03:55.873
[GRUNTING]

00:04:08.799 --> 00:04:09.974
[GASPS]

00:04:18.243 --> 00:04:19.723
Please come back tomorrow.

00:04:19.767 --> 00:04:23.335
How could she
not like the cave?
It's so cozy.

00:04:23.379 --> 00:04:26.687
It is a little dark,
Grug.

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:28.079
It's not that dark.

00:04:28.645 --> 00:04:30.168
Eep!

00:04:30.212 --> 00:04:31.517
Eep?
[GROANS]

00:04:34.695 --> 00:04:36.348
[ANIMAL CALLING]

00:04:36.392 --> 00:04:37.393
[GASPS]

00:04:41.179 --> 00:04:42.311
[GRUNTING]

00:04:54.366 --> 00:04:57.543
Come on,
I have to close the cave.
[THUD]

00:04:58.544 --> 00:04:59.589
[GASPS]

00:04:59.633 --> 00:05:00.634
Eep!

00:05:02.026 --> 00:05:03.680
Okay, okay.

00:05:04.855 --> 00:05:06.465
Come on.

00:05:07.031 --> 00:05:08.076
[GASPS]

00:05:11.688 --> 00:05:13.081
[GROWLS]

00:05:13.124 --> 00:05:15.561
Eep! Come down!

00:05:21.045 --> 00:05:22.351
[GRUNTS]

00:05:22.394 --> 00:05:23.526
[GROWLS]

00:05:28.052 --> 00:05:29.227
[GRUNTS]

00:05:31.273 --> 00:05:32.622
[EXHALES]

00:05:32.666 --> 00:05:33.797
That was too close.

00:05:33.841 --> 00:05:35.364
I was watching.
I was fine.

00:05:35.407 --> 00:05:37.714
What were you
doing up there, Eep?
I don't know.

00:05:37.758 --> 00:05:39.542
What were you
looking for?
Nothing.

00:05:39.585 --> 00:05:41.370
Then why did
you go up there?
I don't know.

00:05:41.413 --> 00:05:43.154
Why don't you know?
[GROANS]

00:05:43.198 --> 00:05:44.852
Stop looking for things.

00:05:44.895 --> 00:05:49.204
Fear keeps us alive, Eep.
Never not be afraid.

00:05:49.247 --> 00:05:51.423
What is the point
of all this?

00:05:51.467 --> 00:05:53.208
Hmm? What was that?

00:05:53.251 --> 00:05:56.211
Why are we here?
What are we doing
this for?

00:05:56.254 --> 00:05:57.603
[ALL GROANING]

00:05:59.431 --> 00:06:01.564
No one said
survival was fun.

00:06:01.607 --> 00:06:03.044
Nothing is fun.

00:06:03.087 --> 00:06:04.785
Huh? Would you come
down here?
Grug.

00:06:04.828 --> 00:06:05.873
Eep.
Grug.

00:06:05.916 --> 00:06:07.396
Yes.
Off!

00:06:07.439 --> 00:06:09.050
Yes, I know. [CHUCKLES]
Okay, I'm trying to--
Off.

00:06:09.093 --> 00:06:11.182
I just don't see why
she needs her own ledge,
that's all.

00:06:11.226 --> 00:06:13.228
That's what this is about.
She's working
through some things...

00:06:13.271 --> 00:06:14.577
and she needs
her own space.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:17.493
What things?
How long is this
going to take?

00:06:17.536 --> 00:06:19.147
[CHUCKLES] Really?
She already doesn't
listen to me.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.278
[THUD]
Hey!

00:06:20.322 --> 00:06:22.019
See? She's listening.
Ugh.

00:06:22.063 --> 00:06:24.935
If she wants to survive,
she has to follow our rules.

00:06:24.979 --> 00:06:27.155
How about a story?
Eep loves those.

00:06:27.198 --> 00:06:29.461
That's a good ide--
How about a story, huh?

00:06:29.505 --> 00:06:31.202
Oh, yeah,
tell us a story.

00:06:33.161 --> 00:06:35.511
Okay. Can I borrow that?
Thank you.

00:06:35.554 --> 00:06:38.557
Eep,
your old favorite.
[SIGHS]

00:06:38.601 --> 00:06:40.777
I haven't played with
that thing in years.

00:06:40.821 --> 00:06:43.432
Tonight we'll hear
the story of Krispy Bear.

00:06:43.475 --> 00:06:44.781
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:06:44.825 --> 00:06:47.915
A long time ago,
this little bear
was alive.

00:06:47.958 --> 00:06:50.787
She was alive
because she listened
to her father...

00:06:50.831 --> 00:06:54.269
and lived her life
in routine and
darkness and terror.

00:06:54.312 --> 00:06:56.619
So she was happy.
[SIGHS]

00:06:56.662 --> 00:07:00.971
But Krispy had
one terrible problem.

00:07:01.015 --> 00:07:05.149
She was filled with...
curiosity.
[ALL GASP]

00:07:05.193 --> 00:07:07.064
Grug.
Yes. yes.

00:07:07.108 --> 00:07:10.328
And one day,
while she was in a tree...

00:07:10.372 --> 00:07:14.289
the curious little bear
wanted to climb to the top.

00:07:14.332 --> 00:07:16.726
[ALL GASPING]
And no sooner than
she climbed to the top...

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:20.730
she saw something
new and died!

00:07:20.774 --> 00:07:22.688
THUNK: Just like that?
Yes!

00:07:22.732 --> 00:07:27.041
Her last moments of terror
still frozen on her face.

00:07:27.084 --> 00:07:28.869
GRAN: Same ending
as every day. [CHUCKLES]

00:07:28.912 --> 00:07:31.349
THUNK: I get it, Dad.
I will never do anything
new or different.

00:07:31.393 --> 00:07:33.047
GRUG: Good man, Thunk.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.876
All right, everyone
sharpen your teeth,
and let's pile up.

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:43.709
[GROWLING]

00:07:45.842 --> 00:07:46.974
[COOING]

